*   **Add Projects:**  Add your projects to the `projects` array in `src/data/data.js`.  Include relevant details like title, description, technologies used, and links to the live project or GitHub repository.
*   **Update Skills:**  Update the `skills` array in `src/data/data.js` with your skills.
*   **Deploy:**  Build the application for production using `npm run build` and deploy the contents of the `build` directory to your hosting provider (e.g., Netlify, Vercel, GitHub Pages).

